6/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,i,n,\\vec A\\in V\">\\(X,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E,i,n,\\vec A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,E^\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,E^\\Omega)\\)</span> (indexed-family predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\\)</span> (probability-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S\\)</span> (random-variable predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}(i,n,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}(i,n,I)\\)</span> (finite injection predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3IndependentRandomVariables}_S(X,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb3IndependentRandomVariables}_S(X,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}independent\\text{-}random\\text{-}variables} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb3IndependentRandomVariables}_S(X,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,E^\\Omega)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(X(i),\\Omega,\\mathcal F,E,\\mathcal E)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall i\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Injective}(i,n,I)\\to\\forall\\vec A\\in\\mathcal E^n\\;\\bigl[\\mathbb P(\\bigcap_{k&lt;n}X(i(k))^{-1}[\\vec A(k)])=\\prod_{k&lt;n}\\mathbb P(X(i(k))^{-1}[\\vec A(k)])\\bigr]\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob3\\text{-}independent\\text{-}random\\text{-}variables} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb3IndependentRandomVariables}_S(X,I,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(X,I,E^\\Omega)\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(X(i),\\Omega,\\mathcal F,E,\\mathcal E)\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall i\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Injective}(i,n,I)\\to\\forall\\vec A\\in\\mathcal E^n\\;\\bigl[\\mathbb P(\\bigcap_{k&lt;n}X(i(k))^{-1}[\\vec A(k)])=\\prod_{k&lt;n}\\mathbb P(X(i(k))^{-1}[\\vec A(k)])\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Independence is finite-dimensional: the product law holds for every finite injectively indexed subfamily and every measurable rectangle. The canonical three-place <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}\\)</span> predicate replaces the nonexistent <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}_S\\)</span> symbol.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"d4d304b0bbb11c1a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"8902399f82dbe8a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable.md]]","embed":fa